<title>USA: Exabyte Corp names new president/CEO.</title>
<headline>Exabyte Corp names new president/CEO.</headline>
<dateline>BOULDER, Colo. 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Exabyte Corp said Thursday it named William Marriner as president, chief executive officer and member of the board.  He has been the acting president and chief executive officer since January.</p>
<p>Marriner was previously Exabyte's chief financial officer for 10 years, the company said in a statement.</p>
<p>Peter Behrendt remains chairman of the board.</p>
